WEBVTT

00:07:59.058 --> 00:08:02.728
We are connecting these women drivers
on a national network

00:08:02.728 --> 00:08:05.189
where they can reach out
to each other for support

00:08:05.189 --> 00:08:06.815
and to share experiences.

00:08:06.815 --> 00:08:08.192
And not just that.

00:08:08.192 --> 00:08:12.530
She can actually ping
another driver in her vicinity

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:16.200
if she is feeling distressed,
if she's in danger,

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.411
or if she’s simply just waiting
for her next ride or pickup

00:08:19.453 --> 00:08:21.455
and doesn't want to wait alone.

00:08:21.497 --> 00:08:26.126
For us, receiving our first paycheck
might be very empowering.

00:08:26.168 --> 00:08:28.504
But for 59-year-old Nagamani

00:08:28.546 --> 00:08:33.634
that moment arrived when she
put her scooter on a center stand